["history-p005-n0033"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0019","text":"时间：隋唐至清末特点：以才学（考试成绩）为标准","bbox":[640.891,372.894,292.418,11.996],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0034","history-p005-n0035"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0020","text":"发展","bbox":[640.891,475.889,23.048,11.524],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0036"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0021","text":"①隋炀帝：始建进士科，科举制度正式形成","bbox":[691.308,409.626,218.954,11.996],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0037"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0022","text":"②武则天：“自荐求官”，始创武举和殿试以及糊名制","bbox":[691.308,438.5,261.515,16.253],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0038","history-p005-n0039","history-p005-n0040","history-p005-n0041","history-p005-n0042"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0023","text":"③宋：科举开始实行誊录，并发展糊名制，使其成为定制","bbox":[691.308,475.889,288.097,11.996],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0043"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0024","text":"④明清：实行八股取士","bbox":[691.308,509.02,115.239,11.996],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0044"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0025","text":"⑤清末光绪年间（1905年）：正式废除","bbox":[691.308,537.893,193.509,16.254],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0045","history-p005-n0046","history-p005-n0047"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0026","text":"影响：中国古代存在时间最长、影响最深远的选官制度","bbox":[640.891,575.282,276.573,11.996],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0048"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0027","text":"2.科举考试程序（明清时期）","bbox":[428.9,673.963,147.548,15.838],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0049","history-p005-n0050"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0028","text":"进士科正式考试共分童试、乡试、会试和殿试","bbox":[603.919,608.413,230.477,11.524],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0051","history-p005-n0052"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0029","text":"童试包括县试、童试、院试三级通过院士者即称为“生员”，俗称“秀才”","bbox":[603.919,637.231,406.731,15.837],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0053","history-p005-n0054","history-p005-n0055","history-p005-n0056","history-p005-n0057","history-p005-n0058","history-p005-n0059","history-p005-n0060","history-p005-n0061","history-p005-n0062"]},{"id":"history-p005-b0030","text":"乡试又称“秋闱”，考中者为“举人”，第一名称“解元”","bbox":[603.919,673.963,285.471,15.838],"nodeIds":["history-p005-n0063","history-p005-n0064","history-p005-